  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "\u2022 <b>Rain Front</b> \u2014 Centre (local): (0, 0, \u221216.95) \xB7 Box size (m): 36 \xD7 26.1 \xB7 Rate over Time: 11 275\n\u2022 <b>Rain Back</b> \u2014 Centre (local): (0, 0, 10.95) \xB7 Box size (m): 36 \xD7 14.1 \xB7 Rate over Time: 6091\n\u2022 <b>Rain Left</b> \u2014 Centre (local): (\u221211.4, 0, 0) \xB7 Box size (m): 13.2 \xD7 7.8 \xB7 Rate over Time: 1236\n\u2022 <b>Rain Right</b> \u2014 Centre (local): (11.4, 0, 0) \xB7 Box size (m): 13.2 \xD7 7.8 \xB7 Rate over Time: 1236"
